        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Conspirare\n- People: Eric Whitacre, Tarik O'Regan, David Lang, Jocelyn Hagen, Donald Grantham, Nico Muhly, Mark Adamo, Robert Kyr, Jake Heggie, Eric Banks, Jake Runestad\n- Products: Tarik O'Regan: Threshold of Night\n- Projects: Virtual Choir\n- Roles: composer, conductor, speaker\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Whitacre was born on January 2, 1970.\n- Eric Whitacre is an American composer, conductor, and speaker.\n- Eric Whitacre is a Grammy-winning musician known for choral, orchestral, and wind ensemble music.\n- Eric Whitacre is also known for his Virtual Choir projects, which bring individual voices from around the world together into an online choir.\n- Conspirare has commissioned works from David Lang, Tarik O'Regan, Jocelyn Hagen, Donald Grantham, Eric Whitacre, Nico Muhly, Mark Adamo, Robert Kyr, Jake Heggie, Eric Banks, and Jake Runestad.\n- Tarik O'Regan: Threshold of Night is the third release by Conspirare.\n- Tarik O'Regan: Threshold of Night is Conspirare's second recording of the work of Tarik O'Regan.",
